id: pm-b1zsk9
title: "GH-676: list tag filter must accept the CSV shape used by tag mutations"
description: "GitHub issue https://github.com/unbraind/pm-cli/issues/676 reports that pm list --tag with comma-separated tags silently returns no items even though mutation commands accept CSV tags. Normalize list filtering and emit unknown-tag diagnostics."
type: Issue
status: open
priority: 2
tags: []
created_at: "2026-07-25T02:06:36.319Z"
updated_at: "2026-07-26T05:57:27.477Z"
author: unknown
estimated_minutes: 120
acceptance_criteria: "pm list --tag accepts the same CSV shape tag mutations accept, matching any of the listed tags unless an explicit all-match modifier is requested; Unknown tag values produce a diagnostic naming the unmatched tags instead of an empty result set; Tag filter semantics are declared once in the flag contract and shared by CLI, SDK, and MCP list paths; Regression coverage asserts CSV, repeated-flag, and unknown-tag behaviour on the same corpus"
parent: pm-usfg
